sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant S as Scheduler
  participant D as Discovery
  participant Y as YouTube API
  participant DB as PostgreSQL
  participant L as Claude API
  participant P as PolicyGate
  S->>D: start run<br/>key = date + slot
  D->>DB: claim run (unique key)
  D->>Y: videos.list<br/>mostPopular, IN
  Y-->>D: trending items<br/>(untrusted)
  D->>DB: upsert candidates,<br/>dedupe fingerprint
  D->>L: sanitised trend context
  L-->>D: ScriptJSON
  D->>D: validate schema
  D->>P: evaluate(script)
  alt rejected
    P->>DB: REJECTED + reason
  else review required
    P->>DB: AWAITING_APPROVAL
    Note over P,DB: operator approves<br/>in Review Console
  else auto-approved
    P->>DB: APPROVED
  end
  P->>DB: outbox: render job
